      "html": "<p>Cambarellus patzcuarensis 'Orange' (CPO), also known as the dwarf orange crayfish or orange Mexican dwarf crayfish, is a small crustacean. It is a selectively bred variety with a vibrant orange colour.</p>"
    },
    {
