      "source": "bwaquatics",
      "sourceUrl": "https://bwaquatics.com/products/cambarellus-patzcuarensis-orange",
      "html": "<p>Keepers value them for their peaceful nature. They are suited to shrimp and invertebrate setups or even community tanks, and are compatible with other tank inhabitants.</p>"
    }
